.766244888305664062", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 7, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "114596731", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995013452", "personaname": "Cluckles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995013452/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 11830, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7558, "last_played": 1701316221, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "A good game, although Earth Defense Force: Iron Rain blows so if you look at that game and are thinking \"Oh! a new version of the game, nice, I'll try that!\" Don't... It's an awful bowl of crap, you only have like 5 weapons in Iron Rain that are useful all the rest of them have a 15-30 sec reload speed... which is an impossibly ridiculous time frame I can reload a real-life .50cal in a shorter time than 30 seconds, and all the classes that you use suck in Iron Rain by comparison to EDF 5. Needless to say, just stick with EDF 5 it's better all around.", "timestamp_created": 1651121661, "timestamp_updated": 1651121661, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}